    {
      "type": "text",
      "label": "The project",
      "title": "Expressing myself through everyday electrical accessories.",
      "body": "Project Power is about expressing myself through everyday electrical accessories. The intrigue of finding meaning in random objects drives it. I use assemblage and typography, working with sockets, switches, wires and boards. Assembled objects form compositions that carry an emotional message while having a visual appeal of their own."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "label": "The metaphor",
      "title": "Power source, power consumption, inner power.",
      "body": "I use the physical meaning of these objects, such as the transfer of electrical power, power sources and power consumption, as a metaphor for inner power: courage, inspiration, instinct. Where it helps, I add text, because words sometimes add clarity and strengthen the message of a composition."
    },
